OL,3,GNEWSAReward offer for info about woman
OL,4,Abeing set alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #20,000 reward has been put up for
OL,7,Finformation that leads to arrest and
OL,8,Fconviction after an 80-year-old woman
OL,9,Fwas set on fire.
OL,11,FCrimestoppers is behind the latest
OL,12,Fappeal after Brenda Raymond was set
OL,13,Falight at a block of flats in Watford
OL,14,Fon 9 November.
OL,16,FPolice previously arrested a
OL,17,F33-year-old man on suspicion of
OL,18,Fconspiracy to commit arson with intent
OL,19,Fto endanger life. He has been released
OL,20,Fon bail with "strict conditions"
OL,21,Fattached.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
